  "factor_name": "DXY-Regime Conditioned Relative Momentum",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "cross_sectional_demean(relative_60d_return_lagged_1 * (1 if DXY_252d_percentile_lagged_1 < 0.70 else -1))",
    "description": "Compute each tradable asset's 60-trading-day return using data through the prior completed session, demean cross-sectionally, and follow relative momentum in normal/low-DXY regimes but reverse it when lagged DXY 252-day percentile is at least 0.70. DXY is observation-only and never traded. The final signal is cross-sectional median demeaned."
  },
